  "label": "Border-Crossing Imagery",
  "description": "The phrase 'illegals that's crossing the border' references the common media and political imagery of undocumented immigrants crossing national borders, often depicted as a threat or problem. This imagery is used to evoke fear and reinforce the stereotype that border crossing equals criminality, which is a key element of the meme's message.",
